t-weight: bold;\" data-eleid=\"7\" class=\"text-only\">Product Description</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; outline-style: none; color: rgb(31, 35, 41); font-family: LarkHackSafariFont, LarkEmojiFont, LarkChineseQuote, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', Tahoma, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft Yahei', Arial, 'Hiragino Sans GB', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(209, 227, 255); min-height: 15px;\" data-eleid=\"8\" class=\"rich-text-paragraph\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-eleid=\"9\" class=\"text-only\">Florvin&rsquo;s preserved flowers are real, natural blooms that have been transformed through an advanced preservation process to maintain their vibrant colors, soft textures, and fresh appearance. Perfect for gifting, home d&eacute;cor, or special occasions, our flowers are elegant, maintenance-free, and designed to last for 3+ years.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; outline-style: none; color: rgb(31, 35, 41); font-family: LarkHackSafariFont, LarkEmojiFont, LarkChineseQuote, -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', Tahoma, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft Yahei', Arial, 'Hiragino Sans GB', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(209, 227, 255); min-height: 15px;\" data-eleid=\"8\" class=\"rich-text-paragraph\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-eleid=\"9\" class=\"text-only\"></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-style: none; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; outline-style: none; 